#//// Neoffice — three fork-only rules, none of them upstream's. CLAUDE.md is un-ignored so the
#//// commit-the-build pipeline is documented in the repo itself (15e512a2, 2026-05-07). The
#//// badge PNGs are un-ignored against the blanket `*.png` above (7d743f92, 2026-03-28): they
#//// are the high-resolution allergen icons the menu PDF needs, because wkhtmltopdf does not
#//// render the inline SVG the screen uses. BVISIBLE-MODS-REVIEW.todo is the per-developer
#//// review queue regenerated by scripts/annotate_fork.py (4e0d3068, 2026-05-19).
# CLAUDE.md  # 2026-05-07 unshipped to document commit-the-build pipeline
\!pos_next/public/icons/badges/png/*.png

# Fork annotation working files (review queue is per-developer; regenerated by
# scripts/annotate_fork.py — see BVISIBLE-MODS.md for the persistent registry).
BVISIBLE-MODS-REVIEW.todo
